      <note>DFT-load_cdm_person
ods.patient -&gt; cdm.person. person_id from map.person_map, gender from map.code_map (0 if unmapped).
birth_datetime = birth_date + birth_time; no time sent -&gt; 00:00:00 (OMOP convention, THEMIS #93).
Refused rows go to adm.cdm_load_reject, with the file and line of the patient.</note>
